{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13356","headline":"东峰亭同刘太真各赋一物得垂涧藤 · 袁傪","name":"东峰亭同刘太真各赋一物得垂涧藤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒涧留不息，古藤终日垂。\n迎风仍未定，拂水更相宜。\n新花与旧叶，惟有幽人知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"袁傪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13356.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13356","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}